# Engine / dictionary

- Pure TypeScript — no React/DOM.
- Vitest for path rules, scoring, board gen (incl. gen-within-retry-cap on seeded RNG), dict filters, **minWordLength** (short reject + achievable targets).
- Single authoritative thresholds/scoring config object; loosen there if gen flakes — never ad-hoc in UI.
- `minWordLength` on `GameConfig`: maxScore/targets/allWords/missed filter to ≥ N; targets always ≤ maxScore.
- Dictionary: enable1 + popular + blocklist → build artifact; load once at app start.
